        "text": "We say that one has a classical zero-free region with parameter $R$ if $\\zeta(s)$ has no zeroes\n    in the region $\\Re(s) \\geq 1 - 1/(R \\log |\\Im s|)$ for $\\Im(s) \\geq 3$."
